Package: clinicalcdss
Title: Integrated Clinical Decision Support System (T2DM Cardiometabolic and Hepatic Risk)
Version: 1.1.0
Description: R Shiny dashboard computing BMI, Cockcroft-Gault CrCl, Hepatic Steatosis
    Index and Atherogenic Index of Plasma, with a medication safety rules engine.
    This file only declares dependencies (install with remotes::install_deps()).
